                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the cart drawer is triggered, when the drawer renders, then it slides in from the right side of the screen — on desktop and tablet it occupies the right portion of the screen with the background page remaining visible but non-interactive behind an overlay; on mobile it renders full screen."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "1af96ba2b314"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "8ff087b9eef4"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the cart drawer is open, when the Shopper clicks the X close icon, then the drawer closes and the Shopper remains on the page they were previously viewing with no loss of page state."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "a3b22b2423dd"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "dc41da08f45a"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the cart drawer is open, when the Shopper clicks or taps outside the drawer on the obscured background, then the drawer closes."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "6a15ef42fd05"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "3ecdba371dec"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the cart drawer is open, when the Shopper presses the Escape key, then the drawer closes and focus returns to the element that triggered the drawer."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "86040cd82c34"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "cbfb413c72a2"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a Shopper closes the cart drawer via any method (X icon, Escape key, or outside click), when the drawer closes, then the Shopper remains on the page they were viewing with no loss of page state or scroll position."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "8c2db0644f0e"
