    {
      "id": "18548",
      "key": "SFCC-271",
      "summary": "Cart Item Component - Quantity Stepper (Increment / Decrement Controls)",
      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": {
          "type": "doc",
          "version": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1. Given a Shopper views a line item in the cart, when they tap +, then the item quantity increments by 1 and the item total and order summary update accordingly."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2. Given a Shopper views a line item in the cart, when they tap – and quantity is greater than 1, then the quantity decrements by 1 and totals update."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3. Given a Shopper views a line item in the cart with a quantity of 1, when they tap –, then the – button is disabled and the quantity remains at 1."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4. Given a Shopping increments or decrements the quantity of a line item, when the quantity updates, then the cart drawer count (e.g. Bag 3), and the order summary, all update without requiring a full page load"
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "73aebfba2fcd"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
